WEBVTT

00:11.643 --> 00:16.143
<i>Heavy stones of fate
are holding down my dreams</i>

00:16.982 --> 00:20.443
<i>It feels as if I'm being crushed</i>

00:22.237 --> 00:26.737
<i>I've been staggering around
with nowhere to hide</i>

00:27.409 --> 00:31.246
<i>But I will never give in</i>

00:31.288 --> 00:35.788
<i>I know there are fragments of hope
buried beneath all that rubble</i>

00:43.091 --> 00:47.591
<i>I will find them with my own hands
and turn this world upside down</i>

00:56.146 --> 01:00.646
<i>Fighting gold
We will shine one day</i>

01:02.110 --> 01:06.610
<i>As long as we continue to
believe in our own path</i>

01:09.201 --> 01:12.329
<i>We are unyielding souls</i>

01:12.412 --> 01:16.912
<i>Our battle against god
will keep raging on</i>

01:17.626 --> 01:22.126
<i>Until our final days
Fighting gold</i>

01:31.640 --> 01:35.685
EPISODE 16
THANKFUL DEATH, PART 2

01:37.020 --> 01:39.731
Pesci! What the hell
are you doing?!

01:39.815 --> 01:41.399
Pesci!

01:41.567 --> 01:43.235
Stop this dannato train now!

01:43.569 --> 01:45.153
Pesci!

01:47.447 --> 01:49.157
Big bro!

01:50.075 --> 01:52.160
You have to stop this train!

01:55.038 --> 01:56.581
Bro!

01:57.165 --> 02:00.001
I-I don't know a thing
about stopping trains!

02:00.502 --> 02:01.669
In a matter of moments,

02:01.712 --> 02:03.797
you and your power will be
a distant memory.

02:04.131 --> 02:07.759
I will revive my crew,
and I will protect Trish!

02:08.927 --> 02:10.011
You bastard…

02:10.220 --> 02:12.555
Bucciarati!

02:12.598 --> 02:14.933
Big bro!

02:18.687 --> 02:19.688
<i>What?!</i>

02:20.856 --> 02:23.775
Prosciutto!

02:26.987 --> 02:29.614
Marvelous work, Pesci!

02:29.781 --> 02:32.617
You saved us!
You used your noggin!

02:33.201 --> 02:34.410
Talk about close…

02:34.578 --> 02:35.912
The bastardo almost got away,

02:35.954 --> 02:37.705
but I snagged him
at the last second.

02:38.040 --> 02:41.084
Get used to it 'cause
you ain't going anywhere!

02:41.126 --> 02:43.628
B-But it feels like
I've got two bodies

02:43.712 --> 02:45.171
dangling off the end of this thing!

02:45.547 --> 02:48.758
<i>Bucciarati must be hanging on, too!</i>

02:51.053 --> 02:53.013
You really are amazing.

02:53.055 --> 02:56.600
You had my life flashing
before my eyes, Bucciarati.

02:56.725 --> 03:00.019
I know I said something to
the effect of you were never a capo,

03:00.062 --> 03:01.772
but I rescind my comment.

03:02.105 --> 03:04.107
I made the statement in poor taste.

03:04.441 --> 03:07.777
You make decisions with
a fair and impartial eye.

03:08.528 --> 03:11.155
You see your own life as
no more valuable than the others.

03:11.239 --> 03:15.739
The boss was right to leave
the girl in your capable hands.

03:17.412 --> 03:20.081
You have left quite
the impression on me.

03:20.374 --> 03:22.376
However, Bucciarati…

03:22.793 --> 03:25.045
You are a capo lacking in luck!

03:26.254 --> 03:29.006
Now, burn in hell, bastard!

03:29.091 --> 03:31.593
Enjoy the quick ride to
your ultimate destination!

03:31.635 --> 03:33.261
Zipper Man!

03:34.096 --> 03:35.514
Short term memory?

03:35.597 --> 03:39.559
You're speeding toward
your death as we speak!

03:39.851 --> 03:41.561
Too slow!

03:42.771 --> 03:44.272
You know…

03:44.314 --> 03:48.359
your little bro's fishing line
actually ended up saving me.

03:49.736 --> 03:51.571
<i>He wasn't aiming for me.</i>

03:51.655 --> 03:54.741
<i>Could I be the unlucky one
in all this?</i>

03:55.200 --> 03:58.953
<i>It's an absolute miracle
that Mista still has a pulse!</i>

03:59.371 --> 04:02.749
<i>I planted three bullets
deep inside his skull.</i>

04:02.791 --> 04:05.043
<i>None of this makes any sense.</i>

04:05.210 --> 04:09.710
<i>It's as if the sun suddenly
started rising in the west!</i>

04:10.924 --> 04:13.343
I told him everything
he needs to know.

04:13.427 --> 04:15.595
Any attack on the fishing line

04:15.929 --> 04:18.348
ends up transferring directly
to the victim on the other end!

04:20.809 --> 04:22.393
Impossible!

04:24.604 --> 04:26.981
Bucciarati!

04:29.151 --> 04:31.111
My load just got a lot lighter!

04:31.319 --> 04:33.529
I must've lost that
douche Bucciarati!

04:33.655 --> 04:36.532
We did it, Prosciutto!

04:39.411 --> 04:42.122
Looks like his age-accelerating
weapon is wearing off.

04:42.164 --> 04:44.332
Now all we've got to do is
blast away that fish hook loser!

04:44.666 --> 04:45.667
Yeah.

04:50.505 --> 04:54.383
But I know I hooked
big bro's right hand

04:54.426 --> 04:57.470
with my line and nothing else…

04:59.473 --> 05:02.767
His pinky was on
the right side of the hook.

05:06.146 --> 05:07.730
But right now…

05:08.607 --> 05:12.110
The pinky is on
the left side of the hook.

05:12.194 --> 05:14.237
I hooked someone's left hand!

05:14.321 --> 05:16.823
What the heck's going on?

05:17.032 --> 05:21.244
What kind of weird shit
is going on over there?

05:21.286 --> 05:25.498
Why is big bro's left hand
hooked now?!

05:25.874 --> 05:28.459
Come to think of it,

05:28.543 --> 05:31.796
- big bro did feel a teeny bit heavier…
- H-Hey, you!

05:31.880 --> 05:36.092
Slam on the emergency breaks…
This whole train is infected!

05:36.218 --> 05:40.138
All those horrible aches
and pains are gone, but…

05:40.222 --> 05:41.681
<i>- What the hell…?</i>
- Why am I missing

05:41.723 --> 05:42.932
<i>- This guy is all better!</i>
- teeth and hair!

05:42.974 --> 05:44.475
Hey, are you listening?!

05:44.726 --> 05:47.103
Tell the driver to stop this train!

05:47.187 --> 05:48.188
It can't be…

05:48.230 --> 05:49.940
No, please no,

05:49.981 --> 05:53.025
the body that dropped
from my line couldn't have been…

05:53.068 --> 05:54.110
It can't be!

05:54.402 --> 05:56.237
It can't be! It can't be true!

05:56.780 --> 05:58.239
No, please no, big bro…

05:58.281 --> 05:59.740
You listening, idiot?!

05:59.908 --> 06:01.993
I'm talking to you!
You, right there!

06:02.160 --> 06:04.871
My bro, Prosciutto!

06:05.163 --> 06:07.415
What should I do?
What should I do?

06:07.457 --> 06:09.208
What am I supposed to do?

06:10.418 --> 06:14.797
No, those guys are going to come
and get me from their turtle!

06:15.006 --> 06:16.382
W-What should I do?

06:16.424 --> 06:19.009
- They're gonna get me too…
- Why're you crying like a baby?!

06:19.094 --> 06:20.720
Tell him to stop
this damn train, cazzone!

06:20.971 --> 06:22.639
Shut up! Shut up! Shut up!

06:22.889 --> 06:25.641
Shut up, damn it!
You some kind of mammoni?!

06:25.725 --> 06:29.311
Move it,
I'll just tell him myself th—

06:35.110 --> 06:37.237
<i>W-What's going on?</i>

06:38.947 --> 06:40.990
<i>The aging hasn't stopped!</i>

06:41.116 --> 06:43.493
Bucciarati, y-you're…

06:43.702 --> 06:44.786
Impossible…

06:45.036 --> 06:47.663
Don't tell me…
Don't tell me he…

06:54.462 --> 06:56.088
What?!

06:56.715 --> 07:00.051
Thankful… Death…

07:00.260 --> 07:04.760
Bro!

07:08.143 --> 07:10.895
You were right, big bro.

07:10.979 --> 07:13.398
Everything you say
is always right, big bro.

07:13.481 --> 07:15.065
Once you got 'em,
don't ever let go.

07:15.150 --> 07:18.319
Keep your Stand engaged,

07:18.361 --> 07:22.861
even if it means
losing an arm or a leg.

07:23.450 --> 07:25.368
Oh, my big bro…

07:25.702 --> 07:30.202
He mutilated my beautiful big bro.
It's all over…

07:30.624 --> 07:33.668
It's just a matter of time
before he breathes his last,

07:33.710 --> 07:38.210
and still he refuses
to withdraw his Stand!

07:43.386 --> 07:47.886
We have to get Trish,
no matter what, right, Bro?

07:49.726 --> 07:53.479
We can't turn back now…

07:53.980 --> 07:57.858
I get it now, Prosciutto!

07:58.485 --> 08:00.487
You taught me true bravery.

08:01.196 --> 08:05.696
I don't just hear your words,
I feel them deep in my heart.

08:06.284 --> 08:09.870
It's just like you say, big bro…

08:10.830 --> 08:14.291
When the dark thought comes,
the deed is already done!

08:24.260 --> 08:28.760
Well, I'll be…
Killing feels pretty fine.

08:29.265 --> 08:32.935
It wasn't nearly as scary as
I thought it would be.

08:33.144 --> 08:37.644
And now, my days of being
called mammoni are over.

08:38.191 --> 08:41.903
This bastardo was the last
of a dying breed.

08:46.574 --> 08:48.492
PESCI
FISHER MAN

08:50.829 --> 08:53.414
I'm gonna put an end to you
right now

08:53.665 --> 08:56.417
while big bro's powers
can still kill!

08:56.543 --> 09:00.421
Bucciarati! You gotta act fast
and get that dirty hook out asap!

09:00.463 --> 09:01.464
Yeah.

09:03.008 --> 09:05.135
So you unzipped your hand.

09:07.262 --> 09:10.932
Somehow this freak has a way
of anticipating my every move?

09:11.182 --> 09:13.684
<i>I can read you like
a freakin' picture book!</i>

09:13.768 --> 09:18.022
<i>My hook is eager to swim from
your left hand to your forearm,</i>

09:18.106 --> 09:19.649
<i>via your left wrist!</i>

09:19.816 --> 09:23.027
The hook is hauling ass
straight up your arm!

09:24.779 --> 09:26.572
<i>Howie that hook out again?!</i>

09:33.413 --> 09:36.124
Merda, every time I go
to pull this thing out,

09:36.291 --> 09:39.085
he anticipates my movements
to the centimeter!

09:39.210 --> 09:40.836
The bastard's pretty strong too!

09:41.296 --> 09:44.841
You think I'd let
you get away from me now!

09:44.966 --> 09:49.466
Big bro's spirit will never die,
I'll get Trish in your honor!

09:50.221 --> 09:53.098
Bucciarati!
The dip shit's down there!

09:53.183 --> 09:55.185
If we get rid of him,

09:55.268 --> 09:57.353
Giorno and the guys
won't be so old anymore,

09:57.395 --> 09:59.397
then they can knock down
this weirdo with the fishing pole!

09:59.481 --> 10:03.193
Understood, but it's complicated!

10:03.234 --> 10:07.655
Get ready to savor the torment
and anguish big bro suffered!

10:11.659 --> 10:13.160
Bucciarati!

10:14.037 --> 10:15.955
Hm… He must've grabbed
onto something.

10:16.122 --> 10:19.917
In that case…
He's climbing!

10:22.253 --> 10:24.129
You're gonna hit
the power lines!

10:24.297 --> 10:26.882
Rip him apart!

10:33.598 --> 10:35.266
I felt something hit hard,

10:35.350 --> 10:37.143
but it didn't feel like a body
being dissected in two

10:37.185 --> 10:38.978
or falling to the ground.

10:39.020 --> 10:41.147
I feel the vibrations of a pulse.

10:41.189 --> 10:44.025
Bucciarati is still alive.

10:44.359 --> 10:46.986
He got himself inside the train!

10:47.946 --> 10:49.948
You lucked out, Bucciarati!

10:50.115 --> 10:51.241
The way things are going,

10:51.324 --> 10:54.243
we're gonna have to take down
this bastard face to face!

10:54.327 --> 10:58.414
Yes… But that's a complicated
endeavor too.

10:58.623 --> 11:00.082
We're out of time.

11:00.166 --> 11:03.252
The hook is burrowing
into my chest cavity!

11:03.294 --> 11:04.295
What?!

11:04.712 --> 11:07.005
My hook is a mere
twelve centimeters

11:07.048 --> 11:08.549
from reaching your heart…

11:08.633 --> 11:10.051
Now eleven…

11:10.093 --> 11:11.719
I misjudged terribly.

11:12.053 --> 11:14.805
Our greatest threat on
this train was never

11:14.889 --> 11:17.808
the man who had the power to toy
with our biological clocks.

11:18.059 --> 11:20.102
The true terror was

11:20.228 --> 11:22.688
the one equipped with
the most innocuous tools of all!

11:22.814 --> 11:25.024
So what are you gonna do?!

11:25.150 --> 11:27.443
That hook is gonna
skewer your heart!

11:27.569 --> 11:30.446
Nine centimeters,
eight centimeters…

11:30.488 --> 11:32.573
Then I'll just have to
teach him a lesson.

11:32.907 --> 11:35.284
The only way to overcome
this cazzone's Stand,

11:35.785 --> 11:38.120
is to make him understand
loud and clear…

11:38.246 --> 11:40.915
That I have determinazione!

11:40.957 --> 11:42.375
Zipper Man!

11:45.253 --> 11:46.629
What the hell are you doing?!

11:54.888 --> 11:56.598
Bucciarati!

11:57.849 --> 11:58.975
<i>He's gone!</i>

11:59.017 --> 12:00.685
<i>I don't feel a pulse,</i>

12:00.768 --> 12:02.936
<i>nothing's telling me
that he's breathing…</i>

12:02.979 --> 12:04.480
<i>Why?!</i>

12:04.772 --> 12:07.649
<i>How did I completely
lose track of him?</i>

12:07.775 --> 12:09.443
<i>How?!</i>

12:09.569 --> 12:12.321
You're starting to worry me,
Bucciarati!

12:12.363 --> 12:15.032
I know we don't exactly
have a lot of options…

12:15.116 --> 12:18.619
But, well, are you gonna be okay?!

12:18.912 --> 12:21.456
I need you to be quiet.

12:21.623 --> 12:24.083
We have to wait until he leaves.

12:24.626 --> 12:29.005
This is what determinazione means…
Number Six.

12:29.714 --> 12:31.549
<i>Dammit, he's gone!</i>

12:31.633 --> 12:34.552
<i>That thing lets him
slip off anywhere!</i>

12:34.636 --> 12:38.765
<i>He could be anywhere,
he could ambush me from any angle.</i>

12:38.806 --> 12:41.683
<i>No, hold it, I gotta stop…</i>

12:41.726 --> 12:44.186
<i>Paranoia is a sign of
mental weakness!</i>

12:44.312 --> 12:47.064
<i>That's what Prosciutto
would tell me!</i>

12:47.315 --> 12:49.483
<i>Be confident, Pesci</i>

12:49.525 --> 12:51.568
<i>This speeding train is nothing.</i>

12:51.653 --> 12:55.281
<i>If there's anyone who can fish out
a hard to find heartbeat, it's you.</i>

12:55.615 --> 12:56.699
<i>Now go get 'em!</i>

12:57.158 --> 13:00.744
There's no way Bucciarati is
as mobile as he used to be!

13:01.204 --> 13:05.704
That bastardo has to be hiding out
somewhere near my hook still!

13:08.628 --> 13:11.839
The line… He's making it
even longer now!

13:12.006 --> 13:15.050
You gotta put yourself back
together and run!

13:15.843 --> 13:17.511
Sorry, not now…

13:18.304 --> 13:20.597
He's trying to find me, but can't.

13:21.099 --> 13:25.353
I'll be fine as long as
I remain perfectly still.

13:25.937 --> 13:28.564
My motionless proves

13:29.190 --> 13:31.108
my determinazione.

13:31.317 --> 13:33.110
Find his heart beat,

13:33.194 --> 13:36.405
find that coursing blood,
find and destroy him.

13:37.865 --> 13:39.575
BORGH

13:39.784 --> 13:42.495
There it is…
but it's not my man!

13:42.537 --> 13:43.871
The weight isn't right.

13:44.080 --> 13:45.456
So a tourist!

13:51.087 --> 13:54.673
There's no question,
it's faint, but it's a heart!

13:55.091 --> 13:58.052
N-No!
He's going to find your heart!

13:58.720 --> 14:00.263
Bucciarati!

14:00.388 --> 14:02.223
<i>You said you would
just stay still,</i>

14:02.265 --> 14:06.102
<i>not cleave your heart in half
to stop all bodily vibrations.</i>

14:06.561 --> 14:07.853
<i>This's bonkers!</i>

14:07.895 --> 14:10.564
<i>A person can't live very long</i>

14:10.606 --> 14:13.191
<i>if their heart and lungs
don't work, right?</i>

14:18.906 --> 14:20.949
<i>Dammit… Nothing!</i>

14:21.075 --> 14:24.578
<i>This place is silent as
a freakin' graveyard!</i>

14:24.746 --> 14:28.332
<i>He must have sneaked off
somewhere else with that zipper.</i>

14:36.841 --> 14:38.592
Y-You've gone too far!

14:41.512 --> 14:43.805
Where's that bastard hiding now?!

14:45.391 --> 14:47.976
<i>That cazzone Bucciarati</i>

14:48.269 --> 14:51.397
<i>couldn't have really
finished off Prosciutto…</i>

14:51.439 --> 14:52.648
<i>But then if bro's Stand
is turned off,</i>

14:52.690 --> 14:55.359
<i>then the guys in the turtle
will get better and come after me!</i>

14:55.693 --> 14:58.237
Cazzo!

14:58.613 --> 15:02.366
Well, you've messed with
the wrong guy!

15:04.327 --> 15:06.871
W-We did it!
That idiot a just gave up and left!

15:07.413 --> 15:10.749
That determinazione of yours
totally threw him off the trail!

15:11.292 --> 15:13.002
You sure showed him who's boss!

15:13.127 --> 15:17.627
Hurry up and zip your body
back together! Hurry it up!

15:29.310 --> 15:31.353
Life is… so strange…

15:32.146 --> 15:33.730
What bad luck…

15:34.023 --> 15:36.191
Bucciarati!
Please just hang in there!

15:37.610 --> 15:40.362
I can't do much more
than control bullets!

15:40.405 --> 15:42.198
- I'm not strong enough
- His tenacity completely

15:42.281 --> 15:44.825
- to move stuff
- took me off guard…

15:44.867 --> 15:46.994
- way bigger than me!
- He rises the victor…

15:49.664 --> 15:52.416
Puttana…
Why won't this train stop?!

15:55.503 --> 15:56.754
What the heck?!

16:11.519 --> 16:15.064
B-Bro!

16:17.692 --> 16:19.568
That was a hellish journey…

16:20.736 --> 16:24.030
One I wouldn't have survived
without a little luck.

16:26.242 --> 16:28.994
Of course, I'm talking about
the journey that led me to you.

16:34.333 --> 16:37.502
You're gonna suffer for this,
Bucciarati…

16:37.879 --> 16:41.465
You got in close…
Hell yeah for determinazione!

16:42.133 --> 16:44.426
You couldn't wait for
big bro to die…

16:44.510 --> 16:47.554
You had to do it
in front of his face.

16:53.978 --> 16:54.979
What the hell?!

16:55.146 --> 16:58.649
Impressive, you have quite
the perceptive eye!

16:58.733 --> 17:00.985
<i>That indignant expression,
those eyes…</i>

17:01.068 --> 17:03.904
<i>They're like the haunting scars
of battle after bloody battle.</i>

17:03.988 --> 17:06.198
<i>His drop dead composure
is menacing.</i>

17:07.116 --> 17:09.326
Simple tricks won't work
on someone like him.

17:09.535 --> 17:14.035
Do it…
Glory is yours to take… Pesci…

17:15.416 --> 17:19.916
Do it now… I will always
be watching over you…

17:28.387 --> 17:30.680
Your death comes now!

17:33.476 --> 17:34.727
What?!

17:35.436 --> 17:37.146
Such a predictable move!

17:41.984 --> 17:44.194
Shooting straight up the arm
to the cardiac muscle

17:44.278 --> 17:45.362
was always my go to.

17:45.446 --> 17:47.573
Of course,
that was when I didn't have

17:47.615 --> 17:50.326
the confidence
to try anything riskier!

17:50.701 --> 17:52.828
When I'm ready,
though my choice of assault

17:52.870 --> 17:54.329
is a line straight to the heart!

17:54.372 --> 17:55.998
Nothing is gonna stop me from

17:56.082 --> 17:58.417
steamrolling you
into extinction now!

17:58.543 --> 18:00.127
I'm gonna murder you!

18:00.169 --> 18:02.754
I'll rip your heart out,
Bucciarati!

18:16.435 --> 18:18.687
You should know that is a motto

18:18.771 --> 18:20.939
best reserved for
postmortem punch lines.

18:21.107 --> 18:23.359
Of course, in our world
of mafiosi, that is.

18:26.487 --> 18:28.864
Did I… lose?

18:29.574 --> 18:32.201
Am I… gonna die?

18:32.285 --> 18:36.785
But… I'm not… just going to die!

18:38.749 --> 18:42.669
Go ahead… and take her… and run…

18:42.712 --> 18:45.339
I'll let Trish live…

18:45.506 --> 18:47.216
He's got the turtle!

18:47.258 --> 18:50.219
- W-Where am I?
- Before I bite the dust…

18:50.344 --> 18:54.056
Let me leave you with
a little going away gift!

18:54.307 --> 18:57.727
The gift of knowing
you failed your famiglia!

18:57.810 --> 19:01.313
Watch me crush this little guy
into turtle soup!

19:01.355 --> 19:03.148
This is bad… really bad!

19:04.025 --> 19:06.777
You know, I admired that glint of
resolve in your eyes,

19:06.861 --> 19:10.739
you had a certain
unrelenting nobility to you.

19:11.115 --> 19:13.492
But you've fallen from grace.

19:13.701 --> 19:15.994
Now you're simply
a smear on humanity.

19:16.287 --> 19:19.456
Fallen from grace you say?!

19:19.540 --> 19:23.752
The only ones falling from grace
are your friends and this turtle!

19:23.794 --> 19:25.420
<i>Your time is up,</i>

19:25.504 --> 19:27.964
<i>enjoy the torturous flames
of hell, Bucciarati!</i>

19:33.638 --> 19:36.432
You're one of those poor bastards
who always manage to screw up

19:36.474 --> 19:38.017
everything in life, aren't you?

19:53.574 --> 19:55.367
"GOODBYE"

19:53.699 --> 19:55.325
Arrivederci.

20:07.922 --> 20:11.467
PROSCIUTTO -DECEASED
STAND NAME:
THANKFUL DEATH
PESCI -DECEASED
STAND NAME:
FISHER MAN

20:25.606 --> 20:27.691
I think it's fairly obvious
we cannot rely on train travel

20:27.775 --> 20:28.984
from here on out.

20:29.110 --> 20:30.736
Yeah.

20:30.778 --> 20:33.572
There's no telling
who they've told now.

20:33.614 --> 20:35.991
There's no question they've
figured out where we're going

20:36.075 --> 20:37.409
and what the turtle can do.

20:38.411 --> 20:41.580
We'll have to use another form
of transportation from here.

20:43.749 --> 20:46.209
There's something
I want to ask you.

20:46.419 --> 20:48.129
I wonder whether
you will cooperate?

20:48.462 --> 20:52.299
We have no authorization
to do any such thing.

20:52.591 --> 20:55.635
You know our mission is to
safeguard your life, nothing more.

20:55.803 --> 20:57.846
Thanks for clarifying,
now tell me.

20:57.930 --> 21:00.349
Who am I?

21:00.808 --> 21:02.518
What the hell is this?

21:02.560 --> 21:04.061
What's this on the ground?

21:04.145 --> 21:06.355
Why am I suddenly finding
freaky dinosaur tracks

21:06.439 --> 21:07.857
on the ground near my feet?

21:09.358 --> 21:13.653
How did a father I've never even
met turn me into a living target?!

21:13.863 --> 21:15.114
<i>As I thought…</i>

21:15.948 --> 21:18.200
<i>The boss's daughter
is a Stand user.</i>

21:18.659 --> 21:20.369
Answer me!

21:24.915 --> 21:26.833
BRUNO BUCCIARATI
ZIPPER MAN

21:28.085 --> 21:30.796
It's currently 6:34 PM.

21:30.880 --> 21:34.633
I got here twenty minutes
after the train stopped.

21:35.134 --> 21:37.594
Prosciutto is deceased
and next to the tracks.

21:37.970 --> 21:39.596
Pesci's body has been
largely mutilated,

21:39.680 --> 21:41.932
some of his remains now lie
scattered near the riverbed.

21:42.016 --> 21:43.517
Judging from the bloodbath
that took place here,

21:43.559 --> 21:47.354
this must be the work
of Bucciarati's Zipper Man.

21:47.480 --> 21:50.065
<i>I see. What about
his team and that girl?</i>

21:50.107 --> 21:51.108
They're long gone.

21:51.192 --> 21:53.652
<i>You gonna be able to
track ' em down, Melone?</i>

21:53.903 --> 21:54.904
Yeah.

21:54.987 --> 21:57.030
Those two disfigured losers

21:57.072 --> 22:00.033
actually managed to do
something useful for once.

22:01.577 --> 22:04.121
I've got myself
a decent blood sample now.

22:05.456 --> 22:07.040
And it's from Bucciarati.

23:37.965 --> 23:41.927
EPISODE 17
BABYHEAD
